AGENTS.md
# Root guidance is shared with Codex code review.
!/AGENTS.md

# Credentials and local secret material must never reach the fork, even
# though this project needs no .env of its own: the app reads DeepSeek API
# keys and Platform tokens from the macOS Keychain, and the DeepSeek worker
# key lives outside the repo. A stray copy dropped here would otherwise be
# one `git add -A` away from being published.
.env
.env.*
*.env
auth.json
credentials.json
credentials.yaml
*credentials.json
*credentials.yaml
.credentials*
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.*
token.json
tokens.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
id_rsa*
*.keychain*

